!! Dot prose-collision safety

Each line below should render as a plain paragraph (no marker firing).

.NET framework starts the line

.com domain at line start

.text without space or class chain

.. text with two dots and space

... continued ellipsis

.aside text dot+HTML-element-name still does NOT match (allow-symbol off prevents the HTML fallback)

''Why:'' the dot marker requires either `. ` (dot + immediate whitespace) or `..<lowercase-name>` for class chain. Anything else is plain prose.